48.rom: the ROM of the Sinclair ZX Spectrum 48K (16384 bytes,
MD5 4c42a2f075212361c3117015b107ff68), as FUSE (the Free Unix Spectrum
Emulator) distributes it.

Amstrad have kindly given their permission for the redistribution of their
copyrighted material but retain that copyright.

As FUSE's roms/README.copyright puts it: the ROMs are copyright Amstrad,
who allow distribution of the ROMs but retain the copyright. You may not
sell the ROMs or embed the ROMs in hardware, although it is allowed to sell
a product which contains the ROMs, so long as the charge is being made for
the product, not for the ROMs themselves.
